`sessions:` must be a list. A scalar is a malformed artifact rather than a single-element shorthand,
and it gets its own message naming the file, distinct from the missing-key note.

-- fixtures/cwd/vault/plan/index.md --
---
sessions: d26525cc-dca0-4570-bfd5-a097daef66a1
---

Body.
